That the request for a Certificate of Appropriateness to construct a new residence at
948 Marion Ave be approved, subject to the following conditions:
1. That the front porch be at least 6’ deep, and be simplified to match the existing
style of the blockface;
2. That the front door be replaced with a single half-lite door with plain glazing or
a solid door;
3. That the sliding window on the west elevation be changed to a 1/1 window to
reflect typical fenestration patterns in the area;
4. That the paved areas and compatible paving materials for the driveway and
front path be provided;
5. That all pair windows on the elevations be corrected to reflect a 4” mullion and
projecting sill;
6. That any adjustments made to the drawings be submitted to the Development
Services Department prior to the issuance of a Certificate of Appropriateness.
